==Description==
The Pioneer pack became availible when the game released onto Early Access. It replaced the more expensive [[Founder's Pack]]. It is currently availible for USD 39.99 with an upgrade DLC for USD 14.99.
[[File:Pioneer packs 2.jpg|frameless|right]]

==Pioneer Pack==
The Pioneer pack (USD 39.99) includes the following items:
* 1x Game Key
* Test Server Access
* Twitch Streamer Pack
* Art of Worlds Adrift (Digital)
* Original Soundtrack (Digital)
* [[Weapons#Drissian Pistol|Drissian Pistol]]
* [[Lamps#Lightning Bug Lamp|Lightning Bug Lamp]]
* [[Clothes#pioneer hat|Drissian Cowl]]
* Island Creator Tool

